", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 90, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8778836, "raw_content": "Core Concepts of the Reciprocal/Favor StructurePatron-Client Ties: Historically rooted in rural exchanges where landowners (Jajmans) provided protection, resources, and security to service providers (Kamins), who in turn offered labor and loyalty.Calculated Indebtedness: Social currency relies on the principle that a gift or favor is never purely altruistic; it creates an unwritten, binding obligation for a future counter-favor (pridhaan or return-obligation).Accumulating Leverage: Men enhance their social standing (izzat or prestige) by acting as fixers, protectors, or benefactors, ensuring that a wide circle of people remains materially or socially indebted to them.", "author": "Stallion", "created": 1786645760843, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "PajeetaPunter49", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Indians can never become true Americans. Their entire social structure is the antithesis of traditional American generosity and upstanding citizenship.", "last_comment_created": 1786665988272, "content": "<p>Core Concepts of the Reciprocal/Favor StructurePatron-Client Ties: Historically rooted in rural exchanges where landowners (Jajmans) provided protection, resources, and security to service providers (Kamins), who in turn offered labor and loyalty.Calculated Indebtedness: Social currency relies on the principle that a gift or favor is never purely altruistic; it creates an unwritten, binding obligation for a future counter-favor (pridhaan or return-obligation).Accumulating Leverage: Men enhance their social standing (izzat or prestige) by acting as fixers, protectors, or benefactors, ensuring that a wide circle of people remains materially or socially indebted to them.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 90, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCEB5r4V", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 19, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "retard", "id": 8779573, "raw_content": "", "author": "I-am-Orlando", "created": 1786676157083, "profile_picture": "TEnkk5XkT6JN", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": true, "video_link": "https://cdn.videy.co/uYUc8LBN1.mp4", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "videy.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://videy.co/v?id=uYUc8LBN1", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Here we have Minneapolis Mayor Jacob Frey\u2026\n\nGiving new Definition to the word\u2026\n\n\u201cRetard\u201d", "last_comment_created": 1786676157083, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 2, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 19, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "RETARD", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCE9wtzN", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 264, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8778309, "raw_content": "", "author": "ArthurJ", "created": 178662468